title: "EdgeSAR-Reports-1400: synthetic UAV flood-rescue field reports with gold task records, and study code"
version: "1.0"
date-released: "2026-11-14"
type: dataset
license: CC-BY-4.0
authors:
  - family-names: "Dissanayake"
    given-names: "Samadhi"
    affiliation: "Informatics Institute of Technology, Colombo (University of Westminster)"
abstract: "1,400 synthetic field reports (1,000 development wording, 400 new wording used in exploratory analysis) with open-incident lists and gold task records (action, sensor, priority), a seeded generator, and the code, protocols and small result files of a study of 4-bit quantisation of Llama 3.2 1B Instruct for UAV task allocation."
keywords:
  - quantization
  - search and rescue
  - UAV task allocation
  - synthetic dataset
